Subject: Cantor Self Work Update Broker B1 CDrive Production Preparation Operator Authority Ceremony Plan P0 Dual Hemisphere Review

@ [review_uuid] 3a17259d-aa83-4cf8-8df9-4832cd5d7d72

& [Constructive]
  + a ceremony plan makes the human and external handoff legible to a small SOP-driven agent
  + explicit roles stages dependencies and receipts provide a compileable coordination surface
  + independent replay can prove the agent did not skip a prerequisite or silently grant itself authority

& [Adversarial]
  + naming an authority can be mistaken for possessing it
  + a repository signature can be mistaken for operator consent
  + deterministic test keys can be mistaken for governed key custody
  + supplied timestamps references digests and observations can be laundered as current truth
  + a plan output can be mistaken for a permit or broker command

& [Reconciliation]
  + every authority starts and remains unresolved in provider-free evidence
  + fixture_only is mandatory and false cannot be produced by the compiler
  + no private-key clock environment process filesystem network Git provider broker or observation surface exists
  + plan and later ceremony receipts use disjoint profiles identities statuses and phase locks
